{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Logging del stack coreAI vía driver Loki (ADR-003). Errores separados del resto del logging. Destino: src/config/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/coreai-logs.json",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["coreai", "loki", "logging", "observabilidad"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Datasource",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "DS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "loki",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
        "definition": "label_values(container_name)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Contenedor",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "contenedor",
        "options": [],
        "query": "label_values(container_name)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Patrón de error (regex LogQL)",
        "name": "patron_error",
        "options": [],
        "query": "(?i)(error|exception|traceback|critical|fatal)",
        "type": "textbox"
      },
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Filtro libre (texto o UUID)",
        "name": "filtro",
        "options": [],
        "query": "",
        "type": "textbox"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "coreAI · Logs",
  "uid": "coreai-logs",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": "",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Resumen",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Líneas de log (rango)",
      "description": "Volumen total de logging del stack en la ventana temporal. Solo contenedores con driver Loki.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justify": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"}[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "líneas",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errores (rango)",
      "description": "Líneas que matchean la variable patron_error: error/exception/traceback/critical/fatal (case-insensitive). Ajustable sin tocar este JSON.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justify": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time(({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"} |~ \"$patron_error\")[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "errores",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Warnings (rango)",
      "description": "Líneas WARNING/WARN del stack (formato Python %(levelname)s, avisos de uvicorn y LiteLLM).",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justify": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time(({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"} |~ \"(?i)(warning|warn)\")[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "warnings",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Líneas/min (ahora)",
      "description": "Ritmo de logging agregado del stack en los últimos 5 minutos. Ventana fija [5m] porque $__rate_interval no se interpola en queries instant.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justify": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "líneas/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Volumen por contenedor (rango)",
      "description": "Reparto del logging entre los contenedores con driver Loki: coreai_litellm, coreai_infinity, coreai_mcp, coreai_worker.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayLabels": ["name", "percent"],
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "values": [] },
        "pieType": "pie",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (container_name) (count_over_time({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"}[$__range]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Volumen",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Líneas/min por contenedor (todo el stack)",
      "description": "Volumen de logging por contenedor, apilado. Huecos = contenedor sin logging (o caído).",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "líneas/min",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": [], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (container_name) (rate({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"}[$__interval])) * 60",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores/min por contenedor",
      "description": "Solo líneas que matchean patron_error. Picos aquí = el panel rojo de abajo tiene el detalle línea a línea.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "errores/min",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": [], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (container_name) (rate(({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"} |~ \"$patron_error\")[$__interval])) * 60",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Errores separados del resto",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "🔴 Errores — todo el stack",
      "description": "Todas las líneas que matchean patron_error, de todos los contenedores con driver Loki. El panel de al lado excluye exactamente estas líneas.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "enableInfiniteScrolling": false,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessages": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"} |~ \"$patron_error\" |~ \"$filtro\")",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Log general — errores excluidos",
      "description": "El resto del logging del stack: mismas líneas de siempre menos las que matchean patron_error. Con la variable filtro puedes seguir un task_id/UUID en ambos paneles a la vez.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "enableInfiniteScrolling": false,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessages": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "({container_name=~\"$contenedor\"} !~ \"$patron_error\" |~ \"$filtro\")",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Notas",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Notas",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "🧩 **Cobertura del driver Loki** [REPO, compose @ main]: solo `coreai_litellm`, `coreai_infinity`, `coreai_mcp` y `coreai_worker` montan `logging: *loki-logging`. Postgres, Qdrant y Adminer NO llegan a Loki — para cubrirlos, añade `logging: *loki-logging` a su servicio en el compose y `docker compose up -d <servicio>`.\n\n🚀 **`coreai_mcp` es contenedor lanzadera** (`tail -f /dev/null`): el servidor MCP real se spawnea vía `docker exec`, que NO alimenta el logging driver — sus trazas solo viven en el panel MCP del cliente IDE. No esperes protocolo aquí.\n\n🎯 **Patrón de error** (variable `patron_error`): el logging Python del stack usa `%(asctime)s - %(name)s - %(levelname)s - %(message)s`, así que `- ERROR -`, `CRITICAL` y los `Traceback` caen aquí; también los `ERROR` de LiteLLM y de uvicorn/Infinity. Es un textbox: ajústalo en vivo sin tocar el JSON.\n\n🔎 **Filtro libre** (`filtro`): pega un `task_id`/UUID para seguir su traza en los dos paneles de logs a la vez; vacío = sin filtro extra.\n\n🧪 **Si un panel queda vacío**: verifica los labels reales en Explore con `{container_name=~\"coreai_.*\"}`.\n\n📁 **Deploy**: copia este JSON a `src/config/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/` y `docker compose restart grafana` (el provider coreai recarga cada 30 s)."
      },
      "targets": []
    }
  ]
}